T InkOrdinate             | AppearanceSpecification.h | 21-27   | contract,nonallocating,nonthrowing | -  | One display-referred ink, packed at eight bits per component. here is ever tone-mapped a second time.
    has   Red      std::uint8_t  [-]  ?
    has   Green    std::uint8_t  [-]  ?
    has   Blue     std::uint8_t  [-]  ?
